      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Sandy Valley sits in the Mojave desert’s Mesquite Valley, bordered by the Spring Mountains to the north and Kingston Mountain to the west.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
